(The same shape with `Create a buffer`: the buffer is held in one place.)
a number called gate is 1.
If gate is 1 then,
  open a file called cupboard for reading at "/dev/null",
  Close cupboard.
Create a buffer called cupboard.

To 'fill the cupboard'.
    For each plate from 1 to 5000, append "x" to cupboard.

'fill the cupboard'.
Print "size {cupboard's size}".
